<title>USA: Microtest shareholder suit dismissed.</title>
<headline>Microtest shareholder suit dismissed.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX, Ariz. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Microtest Inc said Thursday the Superior Court of Arizona had dismissed a shareholder lawsuit filed against the company in September.</p>
<p>The suit alleged that Microtest had made misrepresentations about its business, earnings growth, financial statements and ability to continue to achieve profitable growth.</p>
<p>&quot;As we indicated initially, this suit was without merit, and the court's ruling validates that view,&quot; the company said.  </p>
<p>Microtest makes diagnostic certification and CD-connectivity products for local area networks and enterprise networks.</p>
</text>
